S016888 candidate summary

Added `src/kernel/locking/lock_events_list.rs` with immutable provenance for
`kernel/locking/lock_events_list.h`.  It provides `lock_events_list!`, a
callback-driven ordered event list containing every selected upstream
`LOCK_EVENT` invocation exactly once, preserving the frozen-union ordering.
PV qspinlock-only events are excluded because both frozen configurations leave
`CONFIG_PARAVIRT_SPINLOCKS` unset; queued-spinlock events are retained because
both set `CONFIG_QUEUED_SPINLOCKS=y`.
